WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
- So your new show is about you going home

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:02.930
to Louisiana, right?

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:04.030
So was that a weird thing?

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:05.560
'Cause it's been a couple years, right?

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.020
- Yeah, it was two years
before I had went back

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.530
for the show, so a really long time.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.190
It was like, right when I moved out here,

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.690
I hadn't gone back since, so...

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:14.523
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:14.523 --> 00:00:15.356
- [Kelly] That's super cool.

00:00:15.356 --> 00:00:17.920
So did you get to celebrate
Mardi Gras back home?

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:18.753
Did you...

00:00:18.753 --> 00:00:20.230
- Oh, I love Mardi Gras.
- 'Cause now you're 21, right?

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.490
- I know, I'm 21.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.311
- You can enjoy Mardi Gras.

00:00:23.311 --> 00:00:24.144
- You're right.
(both giggling)

00:00:24.144 --> 00:00:26.000
I no, I haven't been back from Mardi Gras.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.530
My mom is there right
now and she was like,

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.640
sending me pictures and
videos of my brothers,

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.890
like, hanging on the fences and beads

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.640
and there's thongs and
bras, like everywhere.

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.384
- Just to explain, Denmark,

00:00:36.384 --> 00:00:37.217
(Kelly and guest laughing)

00:00:37.217 --> 00:00:38.520
have you ever been to Mardi Gras?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.100
- I was there just after

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.900
and I saw beads hanging from every tree.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:42.733
I did not understand anything.

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:44.270
- Then you missed the show.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.413
Yes, it's quite a show.
- It's crazy

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:48.540
- It's quite an experience if you ever go.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.900
I've been once.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.840
- Really?
- Yes.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:51.673
- It's so fun.

00:00:51.673 --> 00:00:52.670
- [Kelly] And it's, yeah.

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.390
I was like, I don't have any beads, mom.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:55.848
But nice job, God.

00:00:55.848 --> 00:00:56.681
(audience and guests laughing)

00:00:56.681 --> 00:01:00.430
I was like, what was
your first visit like?

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:01.263
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:01.263 --> 00:01:02.420
My first time in Mardi Gras?

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:03.253
- Yeah.

00:01:03.253 --> 00:01:04.086
- So crazy.

00:01:04.086 --> 00:01:05.300
I remember it, like I said,

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.770
bras, panties, like,
people shirtless on floats.

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.200
Like, that's the normal
thing in Mardi Gras.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.880
So it's really crazy.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.610
There's like, I mean now that I'm 21,

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:16.110
I feel like it'd be even more fun.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:19.630
But really crazy and
just so like, spirited.

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:21.830
I don't know, everyone's
like family back home

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:22.663
in Louisiana.

00:01:22.663 --> 00:01:23.681
So, like, everyone's just like

00:01:23.681 --> 00:01:25.520
all there to have a good time,

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.700
catch beads,

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.560
kind of unsanitary, now
that I think about it but...

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:29.830
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- [Guest] But fun.

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:31.070
- The Covid police would frown.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:32.867
- Right, the Covid police would hate us.

00:01:32.867 --> 00:01:33.700
(Kelly laughing)

